84873119137/\u003e\n• 入門 監視\n    ◦ \u003chttps://www.oreilly.co.jp/books/9784873118642/\u003e\nありがとうございます、買います\n\n\u0026gt; trace は本出てるのか知らないですね...w\nなるほど・・・「metricsで収集する情報」って感じで、教科書の中だとtrace単体で書く事はないからなんですかね","ts":"1628098224.107100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Crhn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d18d36ed-ac20-483b-a008-5112145c1b47","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"入門監視は全部ざっくり書いてたはず","ts":"1628098200.106000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"62Nv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"976b13f3-b5fd-4839-bce9-27ae57721ecb","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あー、入門監視!","ts":"1628098147.103900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vdVL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b625a236-95a0-4aa5-baf7-4b0791c869e8","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"trace は本出てるのか知らないですね...w","ts":"1628098105.102900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/PCVG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ad9a755-1bea-4a4d-b5f8-5f7ec868f971","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"metrics なら入門 Prometheus とかちょっと実践的なのなら Site Reliability Workbook の 4章 5章とか","ts":"1628098018.100200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UdkH6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1249380-4821-4473-8c23-b0f39f5a9584","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"あっ網羅という意味には「複数本」を含んでおります！\n１冊で網羅できるほど甘い世界ではないとは重々承知です","ts":"1628097902.098100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ewSj4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91a67116-7bc8-463d-b799-a292b7245506","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"網羅か...なんかいい本あるのかな...","ts":"1628097854.096300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6tn/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fa184bc-5514-4bcc-afa5-4dde16594021","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"基本的にSWEでこのあたり全く抜けていたので、体系的な勉強を一気に詰め込みたいと思います・・・\nもし、「この本いいよ！」とかあったら教えていただく事って可能でしょうか・・・\n\nメトリクス・ログ・トレースについて網羅したく考えてます・・・","ts":"1628097732.094700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bxYf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bafd5469-909e-4fe8-9232-fcd3997d56f4","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"でもやっぱコード書かなくてもいいやつら便利そうだなーw","ts":"1628097715.094300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U027UKB8YTW"]},{"name":"benri","count":1,"users":["U027UKB8YTW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lst"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bfd7c0e8-f4fa-4269-9a62-1ed1e19febe1","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"とても勉強になりました。\n\n・具体的にどう動いて実装するか\n・実装した後、どう動いて測定・改修するか\n・概念・単語\n・各サービスの特徴\n\nがわかりました。\n本当に皆さんありがとうございました。","ts":"1628097677.092700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NU0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52943fe7-e773-480f-9daf-f0656144de26","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"そういう風に捉えました","ts":"1628097434.087900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9zfq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72313b0a-33f6-4118-b5c1-1393e5d0db14","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"傾向をみて、きになったらtraceへ詳細を見に行く感じなんですかね","ts":"1628097422.087300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ppM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2133f196-3d2e-48d4-91f1-44def4020bb4","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、そこで出るのって簡単な集計情報くらいですよね","ts":"1628097400.086400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v0cG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"016de96e-89d1-45ac-8b02-3e344c4b9fa3","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"自分はレイテンシみたいな全体傾向もtraceの集計で見ますね","ts":"1628097371.085000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U027UKB8YTW","UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r5Ev"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e76f172-800c-4bf3-9cd9-0c148417f61a","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"！\nまさに、まさにそんな動きを想定していました。","ts":"1628097329.083600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6xIb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d08a4f8-2a39-462d-a191-fdc90e0ad947","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"最近だと継続的にprofilingとるやつもありますね datadog\n結構いい値段するけど","ts":"1628097324.083500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NOGe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"042f7179-36e7-41bb-84d2-09537691c75a","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"全体傾向は metric で確認して、なんかたまに跳ねる API があるんだよなーってみてから、その API の 各リクエストの trace を見て具体的な関数を特定する、みたいな住み分けと今のところ理解してます","ts":"1628097309.082900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1zjYg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b818a85c-86b7-46f0-931e-447e92ebebe0","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"なるほど、勉強になります\n先程も下記のように書いたのですが、サンプリングという概念もわかっていなかったので漠然と「どうしてるんだろう・・・」と考えていました\n\u0026gt; pprofみたいに関数に全部差し込んでく系のメトリクスツールって本番プロダクトでも使用可能でしょうか・・・？\n\u0026gt; チラホラ見るとIOネックなのかなと思ったら全然やってる会社さん多いらしいので「すごいなー」と思ってます。\n\u003chttps://newrelic.com/jp/blog/best-practices/distributed-tracing-and-sampling\u003e\n\u003chttps://docs.datadoghq.com/ja/tracing/guide/trace_sampling_and_storage/?tab=java\u003e\n\nｆｍｆｍ","ts":"1628097240.078900","edited":{"user":"U027UKB8YTW","ts":"1628097263.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gkV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2445ec42-fd2c-4f52-a852-c5b92581651c","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"リクエストごとの傾向自体は簡単には少なくとも Jaeger はグラフで見せてくれますが、統計処理は出来なかったはず\n// 同じ trace 可視化ツールなので grafana tempo も変わらんと思う","ts":"1628097183.076500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U027UKB8YTW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O2Kd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0f41793-0c03-4469-b77f-adc3c9a0902e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"trace は本番環境で全リクエストとると処理に影響が出ることも考えうるので、大抵はサンプリングするはずです","ts":"1628097022.073300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tbwi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f21d8cae-8e14-41f8-90ae-de6c5e8d8b69","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あーそれは普通 metrics で集計しますね","ts":"1628096923.071000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TvR4p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa95d6be-461f-44ec-bc84-a49925d5a7f3","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"それが、new relicやdatadogではできそうで、grafana tempoはまだ触ってはいないけどできるのか調べた限りちょっとわからず、実際に触らないとわからないかな・・・と思った次第でした。","ts":"1628096918.070800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W/0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5548ba08-cb2e-4879-b315-32e625677714","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"そして、その上で、複数traceの全体合計も見たいという意図がありました。\n先程の例でいいますと、\n\n```時間 : 関数名 : 実行時間\n15:00 : main.sum : 0.5s\n17:00 : main.sum : 0.2s\n17:00 : usecase.add_card : 0.9s\n19:00 : main.sum : 1.2s\n19:00 : usecase.add_card : 1.3s```\nみたいな感じで、本番の全リクエストの計測が収集できたら・・・という感じですね","ts":"1628096867.069000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"viEd1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d9f4191-bcd6-43ee-ad14-b9ce697b3daa","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"おおおお、申し訳ありませんでした。\n私が無知で言葉違えをしていました、ありがとうございます・・・\n\n\u003chttps://miro.medium.com/max/1400/1*FwOF8LlJcyRWzXtEdGHleA.png\u003e","ts":"1628096738.065000","attachments":[{"fallback":"1124x314px image","id":1,"image_url":"https://miro.medium.com/max/1400/1*FwOF8LlJcyRWzXtEdGHleA.png","blocks":null,"from_url":"https://miro.medium.com/max/1400/1*FwOF8LlJcyRWzXtEdGHleA.png","original_url":"https://miro.medium.com/max/1400/1*FwOF8LlJcyRWzXtEdGHleA.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"iinoyo","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3PmL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cdc3d22-566c-4ff6-a93b-ae77175fdcc0","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"span は入れ子になっていて、単体 trace っていうと todo と書かれていたことが把握できる情報のことを指します","ts":"1628096597.063500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kUA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afd5dac3-16ac-40f7-970b-7fe97e86aa74","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"！\nなるほどです。","ts":"1628096510.060700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"heqN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a770f6c-7985-4acf-af9c-a5bea20e0ad4","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あー、おっしゃってる単体 trace というのは恐らく一般には span と呼ばれてるものですね","ts":"1628096485.059700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UNJ2DANJC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+CMPh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f152deb-c61d-4228-8bc5-95d77b649aff","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"なので、単体traceのみの処理時間を見たいわけではないのです\n追ってる過程で単体traceの情報も必要になるはずですが、最初の入口は全体の状態を見たいのです","ts":"1628096395.056900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kptd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7710fc2-8072-4174-963f-4877bbe349c3","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"はい、質問文にも記載したのですが、\n```関数名 : 実行時間\nmain.sum : 0.5s\nmain.sum : 0.2s\nusecase.add_card : 0.9s\nmain.sum : 1.2s\nusecase.add_card : 1.3s```\nこういう感じでアプリ全体としてどこがボトルネックになってるかを見たいのです\n\n```関数名 : ~1s : ~2s : ~3s\nmain.sum : 500件 : 10件 : 1件\nusecase.add_card : 1件 : 200件 : 52件```\nこういう感じに整形したら、\n「main.sumは1回だけ遅いときあったけど全体的に良好だから見なくていいな、それに比べてadd_cardは修正多分絶対必要だな」\nと憶測までの調査を早くできるからです","ts":"1628096307.053500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QL73"}]},{"client_msg_id":"906e75c4-8673-4932-b681-08b2d5711af7","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttps://tech.mfkessai.co.jp/2019/04/opencensus-meetup-report/|https://tech.mfkessai.co.jp/2019/04/opencensus-meetup-report/\u003e\nこれの最後のやつだったかな","ts":"1628096305.053200","attachments":[{"fallback":"Money Forward Kessai TECH BLOG: OpenCensus meetup vol.1参加レポート | Money Forward Kessai TECH BLOG","id":1,"title":"OpenCensus meetup vol.1参加レポート | Money Forward Kessai TECH BLOG","title_link":"https://tech.mfkessai.co.jp/2019/04/opencensus-meetup-report/","text":"企業間後払い決済サービス「マネーフォワード ケッサイ」を運営するマネーフォワードケッサイ株式会社の技術ブログです。","image_url":"https://tech.mfkessai.co.jp/images/2019/04/opencensus-meetup-report/opencensus.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Money Forward Kessai TECH BLOG","service_icon":"https://tech.mfkessai.co.jp/images/common/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://tech.mfkessai.co.jp/2019/04/opencensus-meetup-report/","original_url":"https://tech.mfkessai.co.jp/2019/04/opencensus-meetup-report/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U027UKB8YTW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uz9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0a9ad83-95f9-41af-a25e-a220b75afcd2","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"複数 trace 内の、はどういう意味だろう?\nこういうのは大体 trace ID みたいなのをやりとりしてて、複数コンポーネントを跨ぐときも 1つの trace として扱えるようになってるはず\n// 少なくとも OpenCensus (OpenTelemetry の前身) ではそういうことやってる記事があったはず","ts":"1628096150.050600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xYN0="}]},{"client_msg_id":"519a0837-db1b-4150-9848-26064e6852cc","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"まだ試していない段階ですが、\ntodo: grafanatempoで、単体traceの詳細だけでなく、複数trace内の合計の処理時間も見れないかチェック","ts":"1628095921.046000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rid"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7cebc7b-9d58-473b-a735-7d5ebf0af74f","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"grafana tempoもとてもいいですね\n現時点でgrafanaを使用しているのでハードルが低いのもあるし、別にES使わなくてもgcpとかのオブジェクトストレージサービス使ってれば可能なのも導入ハードル低くてよさそうです\n\n\u003chttps://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F100092%2F9fe8fc98-6428-4318-e33c-07ab62ea0a09.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026amp;auto=format\u0026amp;gif-q=60\u0026amp;q=75\u0026amp;w=1400\u0026amp;fit=max\u0026amp;s=bb76744ea2d94ef4a0484b2671911d8c|https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.ama[…]q=75\u0026amp;w=1400\u0026amp;fit=max\u0026amp;s=bb76744ea2d94ef4a0484b2671911d8c\u003e","ts":"1628095842.044700","attachments":[{"fallback":"1400x609px image","id":1,"image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F100092%2F9fe8fc98-6428-4318-e33c-07ab62ea0a09.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026auto=format\u0026gif-q=60\u0026q=75\u0026w=1400\u0026fit=max\u0026s=bb76744ea2d94ef4a0484b2671911d8c","blocks":null,"from_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F100092%2F9fe8fc98-6428-4318-e33c-07ab62ea0a09.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026auto=format\u0026gif-q=60\u0026q=75\u0026w=1400\u0026fit=max\u0026s=bb76744ea2d94ef4a0484b2671911d8c","original_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F100092%2F9fe8fc98-6428-4318-e33c-07ab62ea0a09.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026amp;auto=format\u0026amp;gif-q=60\u0026amp;q=75\u0026amp;w=1400\u0026amp;fit=max\u0026amp;s=bb76744ea2d94ef4a0484b2671911d8c"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LMTI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38215843-9919-4ff8-a0cc-eb339ff58fd1","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"Jaeger は Zipkin 互換 API ももってて Grafana tempo は Jaeger 互換と Zipkin 互換と OpenTelemetry 互換 API がある","ts":"1628095653.043200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F5e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55a30292-73a2-4618-92e2-45c98511645e","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"DataDog は下手すると金額えらいことなる(一旦こっちの集約サーバーに集めてそいつから投げるとかしてる) \u0026amp; 複雑なのでカジュアルに導入するのはハードル高いかもですね(ちなみに自分はそこら辺設定しておらずインフラ担当がめっちゃ頑張ってるのでものすごく助かってます)","ts":"1628095590.041300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U027UKB8YTW"]},{"name":"memo","count":1,"users":["U027UKB8YTW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uve"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93b41d3f-26dc-48b1-ad01-ab009f708acc","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"Jaeger はちゃんと運用するなら DB が ElasticSearch or Cassandra  になるって感じですね\nまあでも実は trace はそんな過去のものはいらんって話があるかもしれなくて、それならオンメモリで運用してもいいのかもしれない...しらんけど","ts":"1628095500.038800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U027UKB8YTW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RLcy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81a383bd-efdc-4afa-813f-05c88a84ed99","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"\u003chttps://newrelic.com/resources/ebooks/quick-introduction-distributed-tracing\u003e\n\n\u003chttps://docs.newrelic.com/jp/docs/new-relic-solutions/new-relic-solutions/optimize-your-cloud-native-environment/migrate-microservices/\u003e\n\nmicroserviceへの導きもある。\n金額的にもメリットあるし、一番説得しやすそう:eyes:","ts":"1628095413.035800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4R0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79ff877e-e70c-4aa4-9f8b-7eb54f5aedcf","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":":deciduous_tree:\n\n\u003chttps://tech.ga-tech.co.jp/entry/2019/09/new-relic-helps-to-improve-renosy-app\u003e","ts":"1628095097.033900","attachments":[{"fallback":"GA technologies GROUP Tech Blog: New Relicを使って、アプリAPIの応答速度を10倍早くしました - GA technologies GROUP Tech Blog","id":1,"title":"New Relicを使って、アプリAPIの応答速度を10倍早くしました - GA technologies GROUP Tech Blog","title_link":"https://tech.ga-tech.co.jp/entry/2019/09/new-relic-helps-to-improve-renosy-app","text":"こんにちは。 中古マンション購入アプリRENOSYの、iOSアプリ兼APIサーバー開発を担当している植村です。2018年4月に新卒で入社し、はや1年半経ちました。iOSアプリ開発は1年半ずっと、サーバー開発は半年ほどの経験値です。 最近のマイブームは、週に1回スーパーで300gくらいの安いオージービーフを買って食らうことです。焼き加減は適当で、味付けは適当に塩コショウです。 \u003chttp://www.renosy.com|www.renosy.com\u003e この記事の概要 弊社では、New Relicというソフトウェアのパフォーマンス分析サービスを導入しています。このNew Relicを使って、RENOSYアプリ用のAPIのレスポンス速度を90%…","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/u/uemura1shi/20190912/20190912125755.png","blocks":null,"ts":1568272288,"service_name":"GA technologies GROUP Tech Blog","service_icon":"https://tech.ga-tech.co.jp/icon/touch","from_url":"https://tech.ga-tech.co.jp/entry/2019/09/new-relic-helps-to-improve-renosy-app","original_url":"https://tech.ga-tech.co.jp/entry/2019/09/new-relic-helps-to-improve-renosy-app"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d5BzC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec6f25ac-ed58-4104-90aa-0152b3b72e6b","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"new relic、kotlinに顔を突っ込んでまだ日が浅く初めて知ったのですが、とてもよさそうです\n\u003chttps://newrelic.com/sites/default/files/wp_blog_inline_files/20180924_Blog_Spring5_Image2.jpg\u003e","ts":"1628095042.033600","attachments":[{"fallback":"624x296px image","id":1,"image_url":"https://newrelic.com/sites/default/files/wp_blog_inline_files/20180924_Blog_Spring5_Image2.jpg","blocks":null,"from_url":"https://newrelic.com/sites/default/files/wp_blog_inline_files/20180924_Blog_Spring5_Image2.jpg","original_url":"https://newrelic.com/sites/default/files/wp_blog_inline_files/20180924_Blog_Spring5_Image2.jpg"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YDCa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63500d30-7351-46f9-bfca-eb6df81cc764","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"なるほど・・・SaaSならばやはりdata dogのサービスが良さそうですね\n管理画面つきみたいですし","ts":"1628095021.033000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jzi39"}]},{"client_msg_id":"015a1ad5-f914-4ced-ad29-21f1ce5d2cb2","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"zipkin, jaegerは運用がだるいイメージがあるので基本SaaSがいいっすね","ts":"1628094960.032400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"549hQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce3131c7-e1bb-4af0-8706-58a78c4e1ffd","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"なるほど\nそもそもopentelemetryを使う前提のツールを探してる時点だったので、まず勉強してみます\n\njaegerはまさに、こういった俯瞰して見れるツールを期待してました\ntodo: これの一括設定方法がないか調べてみる\n\nzipkinはapiコールのフローが見れて便利そう\u0026amp;lineとかも使っているけれども、今いるのがこの視点の情報ではない","ts":"1628094874.030900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HdmpC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09e5dcef-914e-44bb-ac0e-a36289c2acb0","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"昔は VisualVM とかで愚直に見てたりしましたが、いい時代になりましたねーw","ts":"1628094779.029300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sob","count":1,"users":["U027UKB8YTW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fJd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa76dcc1-cf41-4858-ab73-27e5f70fbc17","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"JVM系のAPMならNew Relicがオヌヌメ","ts":"1628094747.028800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U027UKB8YTW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oDTi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7836fd4-c690-46f5-b686-3fa365264614","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"コード自体を変更しなくてもよさそうに見えるので、Datadog APM よさそう","ts":"1628094586.027900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I+Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc012145-b39c-42fb-95dc-a0083f4183bd","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"正確には OpenTelemetry 自体は各社 SaaS や  Prom/Jaeger/Zipkin 等 OSS が提供するライブラリのラッパみたいになってて\n可視化するプロダクトが決まってるのであれば OpenTelemetry を使わずともそのプロダクトが提供するライブラリ使えば trace なり metrics なりが取れるはずです","ts":"1628094462.026300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U027UKB8YTW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IpY1V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d91c066-9d3d-48b7-85c9-448b76a425d9","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"ありがとうございます。\nとても便利ですね、コード差し込み型と違い、confに設定すれば一括で全て計測してくれるのもとても楽で嬉しいです。\n\nあと、この部分が一番気になっていたので「おお・・！」となっています\n\n\u0026gt; \u003chttps://docs.datadoghq.com/ja/tracing/setup_overview/setup/java/?tab=%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%8A#%E3%83%91%E3%83%95%E3%82%A9%E3%83%BC%E3%83%9E%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9|パフォーマンス\u003e\n\u0026gt; Java APM がアプリケーションのオーバーヘッドに与える影響は最小限です:\n\u0026gt; Java APM によって維持されるコレクションがメモリで無制限に拡大することはありません\n\u0026gt; トレースのレポートによってアプリケーションスレッドがブロックされることはありません\n\u0026gt; Java APM は、トレースコレクションとライブラリのインスツルメンテーションのために追加クラスをロードします\n\u0026gt; 通常、Java APM による CPU 使用率の上昇は 3% 以内です\n\u0026gt; 通常、Java APM による JVM ヒープ使用率の上昇は 3% 以内です\n\n選択肢としてかなり良さそうな気がしてきました。","ts":"1628094446.025700","thread_ts":"1628094035.021300","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jxxW"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"35c462b1-c940-4dbc-a142-c4153a05b23f","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://docs.datadoghq.com/ja/tracing/setup_overview/setup/java/?tab=%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%8A\u003e","ts":"1628094035.021300","thread_ts":"1628094035.021300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Datadogでインフラストラクチャーとアプリケーションのモニタリング: Java アプリケーションのトレース","id":1,"title":"Java アプリケーションのトレース","title_link":"https://docs.datadoghq.com/ja/tracing/setup_overview/setup/java/?tab=%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%8A","text":"Datadogが大規模なクラウドのモニタリングサービスをリードします。","image_url":"https://datadog-docs.imgix.net/images/dd-docs-meta-image.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Datadogでインフラストラクチャーとアプリケーションのモニタリング","service_icon":"https://docs.datadoghq.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://docs.datadoghq.com/ja/tracing/setup_overview/setup/java/?tab=%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%8A","original_url":"https://docs.datadoghq.com/ja/tracing/setup_overview/setup/java/?tab=%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%8A"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b7MKI"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"bb8f0a57-e18a-4926-b670-241a6e69e064","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"\u003c@UG6DF6W87\u003e\nおおお・・・すごいですね\ndbやハードのメトリクスも一括collectできるのですね・・・\n\n\u003chttps://tech-ja.netlify.app/articles/ja537892/index.html\u003e\n\normもtraceできる・・・すごい・・・\n\u003chttps://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/developers-practitioners/introducing-sqlcommenter-open-source-orm-auto-instrumentation-library\u003e\n\ngoogle製なのも安心できますね","ts":"1628094265.022400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Google Cloud Blog: Introducing Sqlcommenter: An open source ORM auto-instrumentation library | Google Cloud Blog","id":2,"title":"Introducing Sqlcommenter: An open source ORM auto-instrumentation library | Google Cloud Blog","title_link":"https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/developers-practitioners/introducing-sqlcommenter-open-source-orm-auto-instrumentation-library","text":"Sqlcommenter is an open source library that enables ORMs to augment SQL statements with comments before execution.","image_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-cloudblog-publish/images/BlogHeader_Database_2.max-2200x2200.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Google Cloud Blog","service_icon":"https://cloud.google.com/blog/static/assets/apple-icon.png","from_url":"https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/developers-practitioners/introducing-sqlcommenter-open-source-orm-auto-instrumentation-library","original_url":"https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/developers-practitioners/introducing-sqlcommenter-open-source-orm-auto-instrumentation-library"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gGhP1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35c462b1-c940-4dbc-a142-c4153a05b23f","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://docs.datadoghq.com/ja/tracing/setup_overview/setup/java/?tab=%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%8A\u003e","ts":"1628094035.021300","thread_ts":"1628094035.021300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Datadogでインフラストラクチャーとアプリケーションのモニタリング: Java アプリケーションのトレース","id":1,"title":"Java アプリケーションのトレース","title_link":"https://docs.datadoghq.com/ja/tracing/setup_overview/setup/java/?tab=%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%8A","text":"Datadogが大規模なクラウドのモニタリングサービスをリードします。","image_url":"https://datadog-docs.imgix.net/images/dd-docs-meta-image.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Datadogでインフラストラクチャーとアプリケーションのモニタリング","service_icon":"https://docs.datadoghq.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://docs.datadoghq.com/ja/tracing/setup_overview/setup/java/?tab=%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%8A","original_url":"https://docs.datadoghq.com/ja/tracing/setup_overview/setup/java/?tab=%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%83%8A"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b7MKI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"919af9cc-228d-4256-9ab1-4e5244a2054f","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"Datadog の APM とか？(お高いですけど…","ts":"1628094017.021100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U027UKB8YTW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QKdR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51b6de8e-80dd-4cf4-8d7c-03a36142e6a1","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あらかじめコードに計測用コードを書いとくと、適当な可視化ツールに投げてくれるやつです \u0026gt; OpenTelemetry","ts":"1628093947.020300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T=F8E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d8e208e-abf6-4ae3-acb3-500de858d001","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"// kotlin は JVM で動いてること以外本当に何も知らない","ts":"1628093828.019300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qzml"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dbe1d7d-cc06-4e68-a409-636fd76609a9","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"opentelemetry見てみます\n\n\u0026gt; Java用のツール\njmhというのがあるのですが、テストがメインなのとチラホラ遅い指摘があって、2021年現在でも使ってる人いるのかな・・・と少し不安になっています","ts":"1628093824.019100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gegF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"825e8184-bf74-4920-8bdf-905f90a81eeb","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"公式にはなさそだな\nなんか魔法の力で Java が書けるなら使えそう","ts":"1628093806.018400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VL9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2e9fa75-a8d1-44f3-9822-31601f6b85d6","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、kotlin 版あったかな...","ts":"1628093764.017200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4bUVM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f420338-1458-4f6f-805b-d01f8fcc4e4e","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"ありがとうございます、まさにpprofのようなものがあるとと思っていました。\npprofみたいに関数に全部差し込んでく系のメトリクスツールって本番プロダクトでも使用可能でしょうか・・・？\nチラホラ見るとIOネックなのかなと思ったら全然やってる会社さん多いらしいので「すごいなー」と思ってます。","ts":"1628093762.017100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TECK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"221384b5-f277-4919-8f6b-ce95690ef14c","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"OpenTelemetry?","ts":"1628093729.016000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QOWS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46200c37-1efc-4bcc-9eff-a4df377c63af","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"kotlinだとJava用のツール使えないのかな","ts":"1628093664.014900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3EX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8d28cf8-73c7-4b35-83da-ab761d8aa083","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"kotlinワカラナイ…","ts":"1628093630.014600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N5O3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65d751d8-2e41-4f5a-b2e3-8c72418caa23","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あ、kotlinって書いてありますね…","ts":"1628093622.014300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QMJg1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a925f98-abc9-4f08-8a1d-d0034556b649","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"言語はなんでしょうか？\nGoならpprofがあって、関数ごとの実行時間は取れた記憶があります","ts":"1628093611.014100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LgLv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75fd186d-5b4c-49e0-a581-93d15c51acd6","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"すみません、質問させてください。\n\n*【質問】*\n本番プロダクトの、各関数の実行時間を計測するいい方法はないでしょうか？\n理想図はこんな感じです\n```関数名 : 実行時間\nmain.sum : 0.5s\nmain.sum : 0.2s\nusecase.add_card : 0.9s\nmain.sum : 1.2s\nusecase.add_card : 1.3s```\n*【補足】*\nkotlin, kubernetes, GCPを使用しています。\n各ページのレスポンスタイムとかはgrafanaとかで見れるんですけど、そこから読み取れる情報って表層だけなので先を追うのに大変です。\n\nなので上記みたいに具体的に計測できるものがあったら最高だなと思っています（これさえあればその先のslow queryとかは容易に見つけられると思うので十分なのですが、もしslow queryもいい感じに見れるツールがあったら最高）。\n前職のオンラインゲーム会社ではあったので、何か方法はあるんだと思っています。\n\nperfとかうまいこと使えばできるのでしょうか？\nそれとも、kubernetesにいい感じのメトリクスツールがあったりするのでしょうか・・・？","ts":"1628093421.013200","edited":{"user":"U027UKB8YTW","ts":"1628093522.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dDID"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"\u003c@U027UKB8YTW\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1628092956.006600","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
